{"slug": "C_S02E09", "video_name": "Community - S02E09 - Conspiracy Theories and Interior Design Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E09 - Conspiracy Theories and Interior Design Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1273.945, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 512, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.98, "text": "Agnes, cancel"}, {"start": 5.98, "end": 6.961333333333334, "text": "my"}, {"start": 6.961333333333334, "end": 13.34, "text": "appointments."}, {"start": 13.34, "end": 16.54, "text": "What appointment?"}, {"start": 16.54, "end": 18.34, "text": "Wishful thinking."}, {"start": 18.34, "end": 24.38, "text": "It's called alternative energy, the key to a brighter tomorrow."}, {"start": 24.38, "end": 27.022926829268293, "text": "Notice all the"}, {"start": 27.022926829268293, "end": 32.12, "text": "animals wearing sunglasses?"}, {"start": 32.12, "end": 33.42, "text": "Because it's a brighter tomorrow."}, {"start": 33.42, "end": 34.42, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 34.42, "end": 37.616, "text": "My boys are in elementary school and they don't"}, {"start": 37.616, "end": 40.2, "text": "make nearly as many dioramas as we do."}, {"start": 40.2, "end": 42.080000000000005, "text": "The whole environmental club is making them for"}, {"start": 42.080000000000005, "end": 43.92, "text": "green week and this afternoon in the cafeteria"}, {"start": 43.92, "end": 45.92, "text": "we're having a bio diorama rama."}, {"start": 45.92, "end": 51.14, "text": "I heard one kid made a diorama about a world without dioramas."}, {"start": 51.14, "end": 53.4, "text": "It's still cool if I sleep over at your place tonight, right?"}, {"start": 53.4, "end": 56.54, "text": "Hey, since we're both done with classes, we can start to sleep over right now."}, {"start": 56.54, "end": 58.36, "text": "Let's get in our pajamas and build a blanket fort."}, {"start": 58.36, "end": 59.36, "text": "Let's do it."}, {"start": 59.36, "end": 60.6, "text": "A blanket fort?"}, {"start": 60.6, "end": 61.6, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 61.6, "end": 63.0, "text": "You can come hang out with us later if you want."}, {"start": 63.0, "end": 66.92, "text": "Uh, thanks, but I think I'll find something more grown up to do."}, {"start": 66.92, "end": 67.92, "text": "Hm, okay."}, {"start": 67.92, "end": 69.72, "text": "Enjoy eating fiber and watching The Mentalist."}, {"start": 69.72, "end": 71.34, "text": "Well, that wasn't nice."}, {"start": 71.34, "end": 75.64, "text": "I'm sorry, Shirley, but who wants to hang out in a blanket fort with grown men and"}, {"start": 75.64, "end": 76.96, "text": "tiny underoos?"}, {"start": 76.96, "end": 77.96, "text": "Hello!"}, {"start": 77.96, "end": 81.88, "text": "So, Jeffrey, I was just looking over your class schedule."}, {"start": 81.88, "end": 82.88, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 82.88, "end": 85.36, "text": "Well, uh, maybe it was a random spot check."}, {"start": 85.36, "end": 87.72, "text": "Maybe it was a specific spot check."}, {"start": 87.72, "end": 89.68, "text": "Maybe I'm making a scrapbook."}, {"start": 89.68, "end": 92.22434782608696, "text": "The point is you will not be receiving"}, {"start": 92.22434782608696, "end": 95.84, "text": "credit for your independent study, conspiracy theories"}, {"start": 95.84, "end": 96.30666666666667, "text": "in U.S."}, {"start": 96.30666666666667, "end": 96.84, "text": "history."}, {"start": 96.84, "end": 97.84, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 97.84, "end": 98.84, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 98.84, "end": 100.7446511627907, "text": "Because the class doesn't exist and"}, {"start": 100.7446511627907, "end": 103.52, "text": "neither does the teacher, professor, professor-son."}, {"start": 103.52, "end": 104.52, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 104.52, "end": 105.52, "text": "That's his name!"}, {"start": 105.52, "end": 106.52, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 106.52, "end": 107.52, "text": "It's Dutch."}, {"start": 107.52, "end": 108.52, "text": "I think it means professor."}, {"start": 108.52, "end": 110.02, "text": "I think it means poppycock."}, {"start": 110.02, "end": 114.44, "text": "The ultimate Jeff Winger blow-off class, the one that doesn't exist."}, {"start": 114.44, "end": 120.32, "text": "Now I have to audit an entire system for shenanigans, which means bye-bye weekends,"}, {"start": 120.32, "end": 124.92, "text": "bye-bye writing at Starbucks 'til a certain Persian barista asks me about my novel."}, {"start": 124.92, "end": 125.92, "text": "Good, Jeff."}, {"start": 125.92, "end": 127.32857142857144, "text": "I mean, it's one thing to blow off"}, {"start": 127.32857142857144, "end": 129.4, "text": "regular classes, but this devalues all the credits"}, {"start": 129.4, "end": 130.68, "text": "I work very hard for."}, {"start": 130.68, "end": 131.68, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 131.68, "end": 133.52, "text": "Can I defend myself and say this is nuts?"}, {"start": 133.52, "end": 138.48, "text": "I've been meeting with this professor in his office every Wednesday all semester."}, {"start": 138.48, "end": 139.48, "text": "Professor-professor-son."}, {"start": 139.48, "end": 140.48, "text": "Yes!"}, {"start": 140.48, "end": 141.48, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 141.48, "end": 142.84, "text": "You're gonna commit to this."}, {"start": 142.84, "end": 143.84, "text": "Commit to what?"}, {"start": 143.84, "end": 144.84, "text": "Reality?"}, {"start": 144.84, "end": 145.84, "text": "Okay, then."}, {"start": 145.84, "end": 147.96, "text": "Please, lead me to professor-professor-son."}, {"start": 147.96, "end": 148.96, "text": "Gladly."}, {"start": 148.96, "end": 149.96, "text": "This I gotta see."}, {"start": 149.96, "end": 152.34, "text": "I have always dreamt of playing charade with you, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 152.34, "end": 153.34, "text": "Just not like this."}, {"start": 153.34, "end": 154.32, "text": "And not on dry land."}, {"start": 169.48, "end": 174.72105263157894, "text": "I can't count"}, {"start": 174.72105263157894, "end": 179.9621052631579, "text": "the reasons I"}, {"start": 179.9621052631579, "end": 184.8, "text": "should stay."}, {"start": 184.8, "end": 189.92, "text": "One by one, they are just made of rain."}, {"start": 198.84, "end": 199.84, "text": "Oh, man."}, {"start": 199.84, "end": 200.84, "text": "You think of what I'm thinking?"}, {"start": 200.84, "end": 203.60000000000002, "text": "We're too big for this, aren't we?"}, {"start": 203.60000000000002, "end": 204.60000000000002, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 204.60000000000002, "end": 206.49957446808511, "text": "Bet if we went two pillows higher in the corner,"}, {"start": 206.49957446808511, "end": 208.32000000000002, "text": "we could vault the ceiling, bump up the square"}, {"start": 208.32000000000002, "end": 212.84, "text": "footage, make this a blanket fort for men."}, {"start": 212.84, "end": 217.28000000000003, "text": "Babu gabu, bougie, babu jabu, babu bee."}, {"start": 217.28000000000003, "end": 222.16000000000003, "text": "Well, here we are, professor-professor-son's office."}, {"start": 222.16000000000003, "end": 223.16000000000003, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 223.16000000000003, "end": 224.16000000000003, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 224.16000000000003, "end": 229.55298245614037, "text": "I don't know what's going on,"}, {"start": 229.55298245614037, "end": 234.76000000000002, "text": "you guys have to believe me."}, {"start": 234.76000000000002, "end": 236.2186046511628, "text": "I've spent a whole year studying"}, {"start": 236.2186046511628, "end": 238.68, "text": "conspiracy theories with professor-professor-son right"}, {"start": 238.68, "end": 239.68, "text": "here."}, {"start": 239.68, "end": 240.68, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 240.68, "end": 241.68, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 241.68, "end": 242.68, "text": "Conspiracy theories."}, {"start": 242.68, "end": 245.68, "text": "This is a test."}, {"start": 245.68, "end": 249.04000000000002, "text": "He's teaching me about real conspiracies by erasing his existence."}, {"start": 249.04000000000002, "end": 253.20000000000002, "text": "Oh, my God, do you know what this means?"}, {"start": 253.20000000000002, "end": 255.4, "text": "That's how stupid Jeff thinks other people are."}, {"start": 255.4, "end": 257.4786046511628, "text": "I always knew you were lazy, but I didn't"}, {"start": 257.4786046511628, "end": 259.76, "text": "realize that you would stoop to such pathetic"}, {"start": 259.76, "end": 261.16, "text": "lies."}, {"start": 261.16, "end": 262.16, "text": "One man's lies."}, {"start": 262.16, "end": 264.84000000000003, "text": "Or another man's truth."}, {"start": 264.84000000000003, "end": 266.0, "text": "Wouldn't you say Jeff?"}, {"start": 266.0, "end": 267.12, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 267.12, "end": 269.24, "text": "And who are you?"}, {"start": 269.24, "end": 270.84000000000003, "text": "I'm professor-professor-son."}, {"start": 270.84000000000003, "end": 275.16, "text": "Wow, you really had me going there for a second, professor."}, {"start": 275.16, "end": 276.6, "text": "I thought it was going insane."}, {"start": 276.6, "end": 277.6, "text": "Precisely."}, {"start": 277.6, "end": 280.6578823529412, "text": "An actual conspiracy to round out your"}, {"start": 280.6578823529412, "end": 284.44, "text": "education in conspiracies and theories thereof."}, {"start": 284.44, "end": 287.56, "text": "Your real name is professor-professor-son."}, {"start": 287.56, "end": 291.36, "text": "My family name was Professor Berg, but we changed it when we were fleeing from the"}, {"start": 291.36, "end": 292.36, "text": "Nazis."}, {"start": 292.36, "end": 293.36, "text": "Oh, I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 293.36, "end": 297.44, "text": "You've probably never heard of me since I primarily teach night school, my faculty"}, {"start": 297.44, "end": 298.44, "text": "ID."}, {"start": 298.44, "end": 299.44, "text": "Huh."}, {"start": 299.44, "end": 302.2465882352941, "text": "Well, I guess I've never stuck around late"}, {"start": 302.2465882352941, "end": 305.12, "text": "enough to meet you night school professors."}, {"start": 305.12, "end": 307.6, "text": "Teeny's gotten crazy good, you know."}, {"start": 307.6, "end": 309.40000000000003, "text": "Well, I have to take this."}, {"start": 309.40000000000003, "end": 311.24, "text": "Thank you for indulging me, Dean."}, {"start": 311.24, "end": 315.92, "text": "Jeff, read chapters 10 through 12 of Douglas, and see you next week."}, {"start": 315.92, "end": 320.68, "text": "Well, that is if I still exist."}, {"start": 321.36, "end": 324.68, "text": "See you, professor."}, {"start": 324.68, "end": 326.44, "text": "Sorry to doubt you, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 326.44, "end": 329.6706976744186, "text": "More importantly, out with this audit, back to"}, {"start": 329.6706976744186, "end": 332.48, "text": "chapter one of Time Desk, The Chronicles"}, {"start": 332.48, "end": 334.92, "text": "of Dean Dangerous."}, {"start": 334.92, "end": 337.84000000000003, "text": "That is going to be the worst book I'll ever read cover to cover."}, {"start": 337.84000000000003, "end": 339.36, "text": "I'm a terrible friend."}, {"start": 339.36, "end": 341.92, "text": "I accused you of being a lying cheat."}, {"start": 341.92, "end": 344.08000000000004, "text": "Can you never forgive me?"}, {"start": 344.08000000000004, "end": 345.08000000000004, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 345.08000000000004, "end": 346.64000000000004, "text": "Here's the thing, though."}, {"start": 346.64000000000004, "end": 348.88, "text": "I've never seen that guy in my life."}, {"start": 348.88, "end": 349.88, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 349.88, "end": 351.84000000000003, "text": "That wasn't Professor Professorson."}, {"start": 351.84000000000003, "end": 353.24, "text": "There is no Professor Professorson."}, {"start": 353.24, "end": 354.32, "text": "I made him up."}, {"start": 354.32, "end": 358.0, "text": "I forged a form with a phony teacher in class for a free credit."}, {"start": 358.0, "end": 359.0, "text": "I knew it!"}, {"start": 359.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "You lying cheat!"}, {"start": 360.0, "end": 361.0, "text": "Wait, then..."}, {"start": 361.0, "end": 362.0, "text": "Who was that?"}, {"start": 362.0, "end": 363.0, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 363.0, "end": 364.0, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 364.0, "end": 365.0, "text": "I don't know!"}, {"start": 365.0, "end": 366.0, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 366.0, "end": 367.0, "text": "I don't know!"}, {"start": 367.0, "end": 368.0, "text": "What should we do?"}, {"start": 368.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "I think we should grab some lunch."}, {"start": 369.0, "end": 370.0, "text": "Are you serious?"}, {"start": 370.0, "end": 371.0, "text": "So am I."}, {"start": 371.0, "end": 374.0, "text": "I just saw Fat Neal head to the cafeteria."}, {"start": 374.0, "end": 380.12, "text": "We've got ten minutes to grab the last lima bean."}, {"start": 380.12, "end": 381.12, "text": "Jeff!"}, {"start": 381.12, "end": 385.64000000000004, "text": "You made up a professor and he just appeared out of thin air."}, {"start": 385.64000000000004, "end": 387.44, "text": "You're not the least bit curious how that happened?"}, {"start": 387.44, "end": 388.44, "text": "My latest theory?"}, {"start": 388.44, "end": 389.44, "text": "Maybe I'm a god."}, {"start": 389.44, "end": 390.44, "text": "I've denied the signs for too long."}, {"start": 390.44, "end": 391.44, "text": "This is so typical."}, {"start": 391.44, "end": 392.76, "text": "You're just going to blow off what happened."}, {"start": 392.76, "end": 396.28000000000003, "text": "Yes, especially when not blowing it off might cost me my free credit."}, {"start": 396.28000000000003, "end": 399.48, "text": "Now do me a favor, be very un-anny, and blow it off, too."}, {"start": 399.48, "end": 400.48, "text": "Oh, sure."}, {"start": 400.48, "end": 401.48, "text": "Well, I'll just blow it off."}, {"start": 401.48, "end": 402.48, "text": "I'll just blow everything off."}, {"start": 402.48, "end": 404.48, "text": "Heck, I guess I'll just blow off walking."}, {"start": 404.48, "end": 405.48, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 405.48, "end": 407.48, "text": "Or now I'll just blow off standing."}, {"start": 407.48, "end": 409.48, "text": "I'm just blowing everything off."}, {"start": 409.48, "end": 412.48, "text": "Maybe I'll blow off talking language."}, {"start": 412.48, "end": 413.48, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 413.48, "end": 416.48, "text": "Blew, blew, blew, blew, blew, blew, blew, blew."}, {"start": 421.48, "end": 423.48, "text": "Iblof, what the heck?"}, {"start": 423.48, "end": 427.48, "text": "Oh, sweet thought."}, {"start": 427.48, "end": 429.48, "text": "Can I come inside?"}, {"start": 429.48, "end": 431.48, "text": "But you're going to feel like a kid."}, {"start": 431.48, "end": 433.48, "text": "No, I'm going to feel like a kid."}, {"start": 436.48, "end": 438.48, "text": "You could, Pavel."}, {"start": 438.48, "end": 441.48, "text": "Or maybe the inside could come to you."}, {"start": 441.48, "end": 444.48, "text": "How would you characterize the amount of blankets and pillows you have?"}, {"start": 444.48, "end": 446.48, "text": "A buttload?"}, {"start": 446.48, "end": 448.48, "text": "I can't, we could call those."}, {"start": 448.48, "end": 450.48, "text": "Mad sleepy."}, {"start": 459.48, "end": 462.48, "text": "Are you here to help me take my diorama to the bio-diorama-rama?"}, {"start": 462.48, "end": 464.48, "text": "I can do it myself."}, {"start": 464.48, "end": 467.48, "text": "Yes, you made that clear in your 11th \"I can do it myself\" text."}, {"start": 467.48, "end": 470.48, "text": "You even work too hard at passive aggression, you know that?"}, {"start": 472.48, "end": 477.48, "text": "Hey, so, do you know anything about Greendell's night school?"}, {"start": 477.48, "end": 482.48, "text": "Yeah, I'm assuming it's the worst thing you could ever hope to be in, only at night."}, {"start": 483.48, "end": 485.48, "text": "Dammit, Annie, have you been playing detective?"}, {"start": 485.48, "end": 487.48, "text": "You were going to Nancy's screw me out of my credit."}, {"start": 487.48, "end": 490.11736263736265, "text": "Just relax, all I did was ask the administration"}, {"start": 490.11736263736265, "end": 492.48, "text": "desk if I could borrow a faculty directory."}, {"start": 494.48, "end": 496.48, "text": "Take a look at this."}, {"start": 496.48, "end": 498.48, "text": "Is that professor soon?"}, {"start": 498.48, "end": 502.48, "text": "His real name is Professor Woolley, and he actually does teach night school here."}, {"start": 502.48, "end": 506.48, "text": "Why would someone you've never met pretend to be your phony professor?"}, {"start": 506.48, "end": 509.1141463414634, "text": "He was already carrying falsified faculty credentials."}, {"start": 509.1141463414634, "end": 510.48, "text": "Do you know what this means?"}, {"start": 510.48, "end": 513.48, "text": "Yes, you are making me do work for my fake conspiracy class."}, {"start": 513.48, "end": 514.1858823529412, "text": "Exactly."}, {"start": 514.1858823529412, "end": 516.48, "text": "There's a conspiracy here."}, {"start": 516.48, "end": 520.48, "text": "A dark, vast conspiracy that may just go all the way to the top."}, {"start": 520.48, "end": 521.7426262626262, "text": "This is Greendell, Annie."}, {"start": 521.7426262626262, "end": 525.48, "text": "If there's a conspiracy, it goes all the way to slightly below the middle."}, {"start": 525.48, "end": 526.8525490196079, "text": "Wait a minute."}, {"start": 526.8525490196079, "end": 528.6172549019608, "text": "Something's wrong."}, {"start": 528.6172549019608, "end": 530.48, "text": "My car won't start."}, {"start": 530.48, "end": 532.76, "text": "Hold on one second."}, {"start": 532.76, "end": 533.48, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 533.48, "end": 536.3575510204082, "text": "Tell your little friend to stop snooping around"}, {"start": 536.3575510204082, "end": 539.48, "text": "night school, otherwise things might get explosive."}, {"start": 543.48, "end": 546.48, "text": "Annie!"}, {"start": 558.48, "end": 559.48, "text": "You okay?"}, {"start": 559.48, "end": 561.48, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 561.48, "end": 563.48, "text": "Probably didn't need to tackle you."}, {"start": 563.48, "end": 565.48, "text": "Probably not."}, {"start": 565.48, "end": 568.48, "text": "Looks like someone sent us a message."}, {"start": 568.48, "end": 572.48, "text": "A tiny, thoroughly underwhelming message."}, {"start": 573.48, "end": 576.48, "text": "I hope you've already laid out your outfit for tomorrow morning."}, {"start": 576.48, "end": 579.48, "text": "Because we're going to night school."}, {"start": 582.48, "end": 585.48, "text": "I stole these from my son's house."}, {"start": 586.48, "end": 588.48, "text": "When does a fort stop being a fort?"}, {"start": 588.48, "end": 591.48, "text": "Hey, as long as it's still made out of blankets."}, {"start": 591.48, "end": 593.48, "text": "Right?"}, {"start": 593.48, "end": 597.48, "text": "These will be perfect for the Pierce's mom memorial tunnel."}, {"start": 597.48, "end": 602.48, "text": "So, this is night school, but where's Professor Woolley's class?"}, {"start": 602.48, "end": 605.48, "text": "How about this one?"}, {"start": 605.48, "end": 608.4624561403509, "text": "No, that's Professor Hike's class."}, {"start": 608.4624561403509, "end": 610.48, "text": "History of...something."}, {"start": 610.48, "end": 611.48, "text": "You can't pronounce it?"}, {"start": 611.48, "end": 613.48, "text": "No, it literally says \"history of something.\""}, {"start": 613.48, "end": 615.48, "text": "Say that."}, {"start": 617.48, "end": 619.48, "text": "Principles of intermediate?"}, {"start": 619.48, "end": 621.0514285714286, "text": "Studyology?"}, {"start": 621.0514285714286, "end": 622.48, "text": "Class 101?"}, {"start": 622.48, "end": 626.48, "text": "Look, this one just says \"learning\" with an exclamation point."}, {"start": 629.48, "end": 632.48, "text": "Hello, Professor Professorson."}, {"start": 632.48, "end": 635.48, "text": "Or should I say...Woolley?"}, {"start": 635.48, "end": 636.984, "text": "What class are you teaching today?"}, {"start": 636.984, "end": 638.224, "text": "- What's that, Professor?"}, {"start": 638.224, "end": 639.284, "text": "- Math."}, {"start": 639.284, "end": 640.124, "text": "- Math?"}, {"start": 640.124, "end": 642.724, "text": "- Uh-huh, do you mind if we sit in?"}, {"start": 642.724, "end": 645.224, "text": "- Not at all, right this way."}, {"start": 647.664, "end": 650.464, "text": "- So, what kind of math do you teach, Professor?"}, {"start": 650.464, "end": 653.044, "text": "- Oh, you know, math, numbers,"}, {"start": 655.044, "end": 656.284, "text": "pi, new math."}, {"start": 660.984, "end": 662.144, "text": "- Ah, get him!"}, {"start": 663.1840000000001, "end": 665.9240000000001, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 666.984, "end": 669.8240000000001, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 671.024, "end": 673.764, "text": "- He went into that blanket fort!"}, {"start": 673.764, "end": 675.724, "text": "- Okay, he went this way."}, {"start": 675.724, "end": 676.5640000000001, "text": "- See him?"}, {"start": 676.5640000000001, "end": 677.404, "text": "- Oh, no!"}, {"start": 677.404, "end": 679.0640000000001, "text": "- Come on!"}, {"start": 679.0640000000001, "end": 680.504, "text": "- Troy, I'll bet!"}, {"start": 680.504, "end": 682.0640000000001, "text": "- Hey, guys, welcome to Fluffy Town."}, {"start": 682.0640000000001, "end": 683.5640000000001, "text": "No smoking, no farting, no pillow fighting."}, {"start": 683.5640000000001, "end": 684.9440000000001, "text": "- We're in a chase!"}, {"start": 684.9440000000001, "end": 686.2040000000001, "text": "- That's allowed."}, {"start": 686.2040000000001, "end": 687.2040000000001, "text": "There he is!"}, {"start": 689.3040000000001, "end": 690.344, "text": "Follow us."}, {"start": 690.344, "end": 691.8040000000001, "text": "- But afterwards, you should really check out"}, {"start": 691.8040000000001, "end": 693.484, "text": "our civil rights museum."}, {"start": 693.484, "end": 696.244, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 696.984, "end": 699.8240000000001, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 701.884, "end": 703.1840000000001, "text": "- Leonard, back up!"}, {"start": 703.1840000000001, "end": 704.3240000000001, "text": "- You shouldn't even be in here, Leonard."}, {"start": 704.3240000000001, "end": 705.764, "text": "You already have three farting strikes against you."}, {"start": 705.764, "end": 707.0640000000001, "text": "- He's getting away!"}, {"start": 707.0640000000001, "end": 710.224, "text": "- I know a shortcut through the Turkish district."}, {"start": 710.224, "end": 712.964, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 716.864, "end": 718.364, "text": "- Rita?"}, {"start": 718.364, "end": 720.004, "text": "- Hey."}, {"start": 720.004, "end": 720.844, "text": "Go!"}, {"start": 720.844, "end": 723.604, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 725.844, "end": 726.9440000000001, "text": "- There he is!"}, {"start": 726.9440000000001, "end": 728.1840000000001, "text": "- What the hell is this?"}, {"start": 728.1840000000001, "end": 729.8040000000001, "text": "- Latvian Independence Parade."}, {"start": 730.9440000000001, "end": 731.784, "text": "Don't look at me."}, {"start": 731.784, "end": 733.484, "text": "They had the proper permits."}, {"start": 733.484, "end": 734.424, "text": "- Dang it!"}, {"start": 734.424, "end": 735.524, "text": "We lost him!"}, {"start": 735.524, "end": 737.784, "text": "Luckily, I sent the diorama card to the chem lab"}, {"start": 737.784, "end": 739.284, "text": "to have the explosive analyzed."}, {"start": 739.284, "end": 741.384, "text": "- Isn't that him playing the traddixniks?"}, {"start": 741.384, "end": 743.624, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 743.624, "end": 744.8240000000001, "text": "- Nice try, Wooly."}, {"start": 744.8240000000001, "end": 746.8040000000001, "text": "Now tell us everything."}, {"start": 746.8040000000001, "end": 747.624, "text": "- Tell you?"}, {"start": 748.864, "end": 750.964, "text": "(laughs)"}, {"start": 750.964, "end": 752.344, "text": "- I'll show you."}, {"start": 753.344, "end": 755.344, "text": "(sighs)"}, {"start": 757.9440000000001, "end": 759.604, "text": "- What is this place?"}, {"start": 761.784, "end": 764.1840000000001, "text": "- This, Annie, is night school."}, {"start": 764.1840000000001, "end": 767.9440000000001, "text": "Every student, every teacher, every class."}, {"start": 767.9440000000001, "end": 768.7840000000001, "text": "Figments!"}, {"start": 769.924, "end": 772.724, "text": "Puffs of hot air from the lips of a ghost"}, {"start": 772.724, "end": 774.7840000000001, "text": "in the shadow of a unicorn's dream."}, {"start": 775.864, "end": 776.964, "text": "I made it up!"}, {"start": 776.964, "end": 778.124, "text": "Night school doesn't exist."}, {"start": 778.124, "end": 780.524, "text": "I used to be a student here at Greendale like you, Jeff."}, {"start": 780.524, "end": 783.164, "text": "And then one day I invented a fake course"}, {"start": 783.164, "end": 784.464, "text": "to get a free credit."}, {"start": 784.464, "end": 786.5640000000001, "text": "To keep up the lie, I had to create a fake teacher"}, {"start": 786.5640000000001, "end": 788.504, "text": "who needed other fake classes"}, {"start": 788.504, "end": 790.644, "text": "that needed to be filled with other fake students"}, {"start": 790.644, "end": 794.0840000000001, "text": "and so on and so on and so on, et cetera."}, {"start": 794.0840000000001, "end": 795.9440000000001, "text": "- Did you just mispronounce et cetera?"}, {"start": 795.9440000000001, "end": 797.984, "text": "- My Latin class is fake, Jeff."}, {"start": 797.984, "end": 799.684, "text": "Like all my classes, like my life."}, {"start": 799.684, "end": 800.524, "text": "Aren't you listening?"}, {"start": 800.524, "end": 801.8240000000001, "text": "- Yeah, I am."}, {"start": 801.8240000000001, "end": 805.184, "text": "And a very familiar feeling is starting to come over me."}, {"start": 805.184, "end": 807.3240000000001, "text": "I feel like someone is trying to teach me something."}, {"start": 807.3240000000001, "end": 808.924, "text": "- Jeff, the only thing that's ever been learned"}, {"start": 808.924, "end": 810.264, "text": "in this room is regret."}, {"start": 811.964, "end": 814.364, "text": "Would that this desk were a time desk"}, {"start": 815.604, "end": 818.764, "text": "so that I could correct my past mistakes?"}, {"start": 818.764, "end": 820.0640000000001, "text": "Ride dinosaurs."}, {"start": 821.264, "end": 822.464, "text": "Fight with Jack the Ripper."}, {"start": 822.464, "end": 824.244, "text": "Wait a minute, wait a minute."}, {"start": 824.244, "end": 827.9440000000001, "text": "Unicorns, ghost lips, time desks."}, {"start": 827.9440000000001, "end": 830.4440000000001, "text": "Doesn't any of this overly stylized garbage"}, {"start": 830.4440000000001, "end": 832.244, "text": "remind you of anyone?"}, {"start": 832.244, "end": 834.124, "text": "Everything this guy says is ripped from the shirt"}, {"start": 834.124, "end": 838.624, "text": "to be unpublished pages of Dean Dangerous."}, {"start": 838.624, "end": 839.7840000000001, "text": "- I don't know what you mean."}, {"start": 839.7840000000001, "end": 841.124, "text": "- Oh, I think you do."}, {"start": 841.124, "end": 843.964, "text": "By the way, next time you walk someone to your fake lair,"}, {"start": 843.964, "end": 846.624, "text": "don't pass the theater department."}, {"start": 846.624, "end": 849.024, "text": "Drama professor Sean Garrity."}, {"start": 849.024, "end": 851.404, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 851.404, "end": 852.244, "text": "- Whoa."}, {"start": 857.504, "end": 859.2840000000001, "text": "- Thank God, that character was killing me."}, {"start": 859.2840000000001, "end": 862.384, "text": "Word of advice, if you ever scrape the Dean's car,"}, {"start": 862.384, "end": 864.644, "text": "don't tell him you're gonna pay him back in acting."}, {"start": 864.644, "end": 867.884, "text": "On Thanksgiving, I'm supposed to crash his family dinner"}, {"start": 867.884, "end": 870.024, "text": "and accuse him of stealing my girlfriend."}, {"start": 870.024, "end": 873.0840000000001, "text": "- Wow, I guess this did go all the way to the top."}, {"start": 874.0640000000001, "end": 875.424, "text": "I'm calling the Dean right now"}, {"start": 875.424, "end": 877.924, "text": "and giving him a piece of my mind."}, {"start": 877.924, "end": 879.424, "text": "- No, wait."}, {"start": 879.424, "end": 882.2040000000001, "text": "Garrity, does the theater department"}, {"start": 882.2040000000001, "end": 885.004, "text": "have any of those prop guns that fire blanks?"}, {"start": 885.004, "end": 887.3040000000001, "text": "Of course, we just did a modern retelling of Macbeth"}, {"start": 887.3040000000001, "end": 889.0440000000001, "text": "set in Gangland, Chicago."}, {"start": 889.0440000000001, "end": 890.9440000000001, "text": "Oh, fresh take."}, {"start": 890.9440000000001, "end": 892.5840000000001, "text": "And you think I'm lazy."}, {"start": 892.5840000000001, "end": 893.904, "text": "- Prop guns?"}, {"start": 893.904, "end": 895.944, "text": "Jeff, what do you have in mind?"}, {"start": 895.944, "end": 897.744, "text": "- A little demonstration for the Dean"}, {"start": 897.744, "end": 900.0240000000001, "text": "on the dangers of trying to educate me."}, {"start": 900.0240000000001, "end": 901.684, "text": "He doesn't like fake glasses?"}, {"start": 901.684, "end": 903.884, "text": "Well, he's about to get a real lesson"}, {"start": 903.884, "end": 907.0640000000001, "text": "on the fact that Jeff Winger never learns."}, {"start": 907.0640000000001, "end": 909.124, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 909.124, "end": 910.224, "text": "- Here he comes."}, {"start": 912.7639999999999, "end": 913.6039999999998, "text": "Get set."}, {"start": 917.0439999999999, "end": 918.704, "text": "- You wanted to see me?"}, {"start": 918.704, "end": 920.1614999999999, "text": "Oh, hi, Mr."}, {"start": 920.1614999999999, "end": 921.8839999999999, "text": "Professorson."}, {"start": 921.8839999999999, "end": 924.0839999999998, "text": "His real name is Wooly."}, {"start": 924.0839999999998, "end": 926.0839999999998, "text": "And he has defrauded your school to the tune"}, {"start": 926.0839999999998, "end": 927.8839999999999, "text": "of dozens of credits per year"}, {"start": 927.8839999999999, "end": 930.4239999999999, "text": "and nearly twice as many dollars."}, {"start": 930.4239999999999, "end": 931.6439999999999, "text": "Well, that's serious."}, {"start": 932.9239999999999, "end": 935.4839999999999, "text": "Fortunately for you, I'm a big believer in second chances."}, {"start": 935.4839999999999, "end": 936.7239999999999, "text": "- I'm not."}, {"start": 936.7239999999999, "end": 938.3639999999998, "text": "(gunshot)"}, {"start": 938.3639999999998, "end": 939.5639999999999, "text": "- Annie!"}, {"start": 939.5639999999999, "end": 940.6639999999999, "text": "Annie!"}, {"start": 940.6639999999999, "end": 942.7239999999999, "text": "Oh my God, you shot him!"}, {"start": 942.7239999999999, "end": 944.1039999999998, "text": "- Of course I shot him."}, {"start": 944.1039999999998, "end": 945.6039999999998, "text": "He was being dishonest."}, {"start": 945.6039999999998, "end": 947.7639999999999, "text": "And if there's one thing Greendale's taught me,"}, {"start": 947.7639999999999, "end": 948.9639999999999, "text": "(gunshot)"}, {"start": 948.9639999999999, "end": 950.0439999999999, "text": "- Well, what the hell?"}, {"start": 950.0439999999999, "end": 950.944, "text": "- She had a gun!"}, {"start": 950.944, "end": 952.204, "text": "- It was a fake gun."}, {"start": 952.204, "end": 954.444, "text": "We staged this to get back at you for deceiving us."}, {"start": 954.444, "end": 956.0439999999999, "text": "- Well, you're the deceiver, Jeffery."}, {"start": 956.0439999999999, "end": 958.444, "text": "- Yeah, well now you're the dead guy."}, {"start": 958.444, "end": 961.6239999999999, "text": "(gunshot)"}, {"start": 961.6239999999999, "end": 963.4839999999999, "text": "- Jeff, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 963.4839999999999, "end": 965.7239999999999, "text": "Why do you have a real gun?"}, {"start": 965.7239999999999, "end": 967.5839999999998, "text": "Why did you shoot the Dean?"}, {"start": 967.5839999999998, "end": 968.7839999999999, "text": "- Well, he shot you."}, {"start": 968.7839999999999, "end": 970.0839999999998, "text": "- Not really."}, {"start": 970.0839999999998, "end": 972.2839999999999, "text": "He and I were in on this from the start."}, {"start": 972.2839999999999, "end": 973.9239999999999, "text": "When he found out you were picking a class,"}, {"start": 973.9239999999999, "end": 976.8639999999998, "text": "he came to me and we cooked up this whole conspiracy thing"}, {"start": 976.8639999999998, "end": 981.1639999999999, "text": "to illustrate the slippery slope of academic fraud."}, {"start": 981.1639999999999, "end": 983.6639999999999, "text": "- You know what you actually illustrated, Annie?"}, {"start": 985.7439999999999, "end": 987.1039999999998, "text": "How to be a crappy friend."}, {"start": 988.3439999999998, "end": 991.7439999999999, "text": "Once it was obvious the Dean had orchestrated everything,"}, {"start": 991.7439999999999, "end": 993.944, "text": "it was even more obvious the Dean was too stupid"}, {"start": 993.944, "end": 995.444, "text": "to orchestrate anything."}, {"start": 995.444, "end": 996.6439999999999, "text": "- Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 996.6439999999999, "end": 999.6239999999999, "text": "- So on a hunch, I called him and we hatched a plan"}, {"start": 999.6239999999999, "end": 1002.184, "text": "to teach you a lesson or two about friendship."}, {"start": 1002.184, "end": 1004.4639999999999, "text": "- Look, Jeff, I only did it because I love you."}, {"start": 1006.5839999999998, "end": 1008.3239999999998, "text": "- Well, when you love someone,"}, {"start": 1008.3239999999998, "end": 1010.4639999999999, "text": "you have to take them as they are."}, {"start": 1010.4639999999999, "end": 1012.4639999999999, "text": "People aren't playthings, Annie."}, {"start": 1012.4639999999999, "end": 1013.4639999999999, "text": "- No, they are not."}, {"start": 1013.4639999999999, "end": 1015.4039999999999, "text": "- Oh, look who's talking."}, {"start": 1015.4039999999999, "end": 1017.704, "text": "After everything you put me through."}, {"start": 1017.704, "end": 1019.204, "text": "- Okay."}, {"start": 1019.204, "end": 1020.5039999999999, "text": "Where'd you get that gun?"}, {"start": 1022.3039999999999, "end": 1024.504, "text": "- They're only three prop guns."}, {"start": 1024.504, "end": 1026.204, "text": "- Well, I live in a terrible neighborhood."}, {"start": 1026.204, "end": 1028.6439999999998, "text": "- Danny, put the gun down."}, {"start": 1028.6439999999998, "end": 1032.944, "text": "- After we kissed, I waited all summer to see you."}, {"start": 1032.944, "end": 1036.724, "text": "You buried me like a shameful secret."}, {"start": 1036.724, "end": 1037.5639999999999, "text": "- Whoa."}, {"start": 1037.5639999999999, "end": 1039.3239999999998, "text": "- What's the matter, Jeff?"}, {"start": 1039.3239999999998, "end": 1041.8639999999998, "text": "If I'm crazy, Annie would go crazy for you."}, {"start": 1042.964, "end": 1043.8039999999999, "text": "Well, guess what?"}, {"start": 1044.724, "end": 1046.024, "text": "Annie's got a gun."}, {"start": 1046.024, "end": 1046.924, "text": "- Annie, just put the gun down."}, {"start": 1046.924, "end": 1047.764, "text": "(gun fires)"}, {"start": 1047.764, "end": 1048.6039999999998, "text": "- Whoa!"}, {"start": 1048.6039999999998, "end": 1050.764, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1052.704, "end": 1057.204, "text": "- Oh, Annie, what have you done?"}, {"start": 1057.204, "end": 1059.0439999999999, "text": "- If you love Jeff Wigler so much,"}, {"start": 1059.0439999999999, "end": 1061.1439999999998, "text": "why did you conspire with me against him?"}, {"start": 1061.1439999999998, "end": 1062.5839999999998, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 1062.5839999999998, "end": 1066.024, "text": "I can't keep track of any of it anymore."}, {"start": 1066.024, "end": 1069.224, "text": "I just keep teaming up with whoever suggested."}, {"start": 1069.224, "end": 1070.884, "text": "- Glad to hear you admit it."}, {"start": 1070.884, "end": 1072.264, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1072.264, "end": 1074.5639999999999, "text": "When I called you to ask you to double cross Annie,"}, {"start": 1074.5639999999999, "end": 1076.1639999999998, "text": "you didn't hesitate for a second."}, {"start": 1076.1639999999998, "end": 1078.264, "text": "- Do you even understand what a conspiracy is?"}, {"start": 1078.264, "end": 1080.464, "text": "If you conspire with every person that approaches you,"}, {"start": 1080.464, "end": 1082.464, "text": "you're not even really conspiring with anyone."}, {"start": 1082.464, "end": 1084.5439999999999, "text": "You're just doing random crap."}, {"start": 1084.5439999999999, "end": 1086.8439999999998, "text": "- I know, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 1086.8439999999998, "end": 1090.204, "text": "I just want to have fun with you guys"}, {"start": 1090.204, "end": 1094.0839999999998, "text": "and I go crazy, cooped up in my little office"}, {"start": 1094.0839999999998, "end": 1099.0839999999998, "text": "and time travel is really hard to write about."}, {"start": 1099.684, "end": 1101.7839999999999, "text": "- Oh, okay."}, {"start": 1102.684, "end": 1104.884, "text": "If I'm keeping track right, we should be done."}, {"start": 1106.2839999999999, "end": 1108.6639999999998, "text": "I'll just take these back to the theater department."}, {"start": 1110.464, "end": 1113.6039999999998, "text": "Police, drop the weapons, dead on the ground."}, {"start": 1113.6039999999998, "end": 1114.904, "text": "- Don't shoot, officer, don't shoot."}, {"start": 1114.904, "end": 1116.1639999999998, "text": "Please, they're facing me."}, {"start": 1116.1639999999998, "end": 1118.3439999999998, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 1119.8039999999999, "end": 1122.5439999999999, "text": "- Those are prop guns."}, {"start": 1122.5439999999999, "end": 1126.0839999999998, "text": "- Well, I guess it just goes to show you,"}, {"start": 1126.0839999999998, "end": 1128.684, "text": "prop guns belong backstage."}, {"start": 1128.684, "end": 1131.1239999999998, "text": "- And scene."}, {"start": 1131.1239999999998, "end": 1133.7839999999999, "text": "- You have got to be kidding me."}, {"start": 1134.884, "end": 1136.0639999999999, "text": "- Professor Garity called and told me"}, {"start": 1136.0639999999999, "end": 1137.464, "text": "what all of you were up to."}, {"start": 1137.464, "end": 1138.684, "text": "Made me mad."}, {"start": 1138.684, "end": 1142.3639999999998, "text": "- Guns aren't toys, fact."}, {"start": 1142.3639999999998, "end": 1145.264, "text": "In 100% of all fake gun related shootings,"}, {"start": 1145.264, "end": 1147.704, "text": "the victim is always the one with the fake gun."}, {"start": 1149.0639999999999, "end": 1150.744, "text": "Hey Sean, you got breakfast plans?"}, {"start": 1150.744, "end": 1152.244, "text": "- I do now."}, {"start": 1152.244, "end": 1157.244, "text": "- So Sean, we're still on for Thanksgiving, right?"}, {"start": 1158.0839999999998, "end": 1159.5839999999998, "text": "- Just talk to your father, Craig."}, {"start": 1159.5839999999998, "end": 1161.884, "text": "- Oh, was that this hoodie?"}, {"start": 1161.884, "end": 1163.984, "text": "We're a time hoodie."}, {"start": 1165.5839999999998, "end": 1168.0839999999998, "text": "- Hey Dean, how about that credit?"}, {"start": 1168.0839999999998, "end": 1168.924, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 1171.5639999999999, "end": 1173.024, "text": "- I'm not really sure what lessons"}, {"start": 1173.024, "end": 1174.264, "text": "we've managed to teach each other,"}, {"start": 1174.264, "end": 1176.1639999999998, "text": "but I'm proud of Annie."}, {"start": 1176.1639999999998, "end": 1180.004, "text": "- She took the deception like Abed took to Cougar Town."}, {"start": 1180.004, "end": 1181.864, "text": "Especially when she went off script."}, {"start": 1183.244, "end": 1185.1439999999998, "text": "- You said to be convincing."}, {"start": 1185.1439999999998, "end": 1186.744, "text": "- Take it off, those."}, {"start": 1186.744, "end": 1188.7039999999997, "text": "You made the front page."}, {"start": 1192.944, "end": 1194.6439999999998, "text": "- You know what this means."}, {"start": 1194.6439999999998, "end": 1196.344, "text": "- We've gone mainstream."}, {"start": 1196.344, "end": 1198.2839999999999, "text": "Initiate protocol, Omega."}, {"start": 1198.2839999999999, "end": 1201.024, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1223.8039999999999, "end": 1225.1839999999997, "text": "- We've started looting."}, {"start": 1226.344, "end": 1229.1839999999997, "text": "(crowd murmuring)"}, {"start": 1230.344, "end": 1232.0839999999998, "text": "Wanna build a cardboard submarine?"}, {"start": 1233.2839999999999, "end": 1234.484, "text": "- Get out of my brain."}, {"start": 1234.484, "end": 1239.484, "text": "- Once a time there was a big spaceship."}, {"start": 1245.904, "end": 1246.6, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1246.6, "end": 1247.644, "text": "- Aliens."}, {"start": 1247.644, "end": 1248.214, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1248.214, "end": 1249.5439999999999, "text": "- Mercenaries."}, {"start": 1249.5439999999999, "end": 1250.164, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1250.164, "end": 1250.784, "text": "- War."}, {"start": 1251.744, "end": 1252.3792941176469, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1252.3792941176469, "end": 1253.5439999999999, "text": "- Betrayal."}, {"start": 1254.824, "end": 1255.784, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1255.784, "end": 1257.384, "text": "- Romance."}, {"start": 1257.384, "end": 1257.984, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1257.984, "end": 1258.884, "text": "- Karate."}, {"start": 1258.884, "end": 1259.484, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1259.484, "end": 1260.484, "text": "- Credits."}, {"start": 1260.484, "end": 1260.934, "text": "- The."}, {"start": 1260.934, "end": 1261.384, "text": "- And."}, {"start": 1262.524, "end": 1264.264, "text": "- We should write a screenplay together."}, {"start": 1264.264, "end": 1265.764, "text": "- Cool, cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 1265.764, "end": 1268.504, "text": "(dramatic music)"}]}